## Escalation Paths

| Situation | Escalate To |
|---|---|
<% if (modules.backend) { %>
| Backend bugs found during diff review | **backend** |
<% } %>
<% if (modules.mobile || modules.web) { %>
| Frontend bugs found during diff review | **frontend** |
<% } %>
<% if (integrations.cicd) { %>
| CI/CD pipeline failures, workflow issues | **cicd** |
<% } %>
| Security vulnerabilities in committed code | **security** |
<% if (modules.backend && (modules.mobile || modules.web)) { %>
