## Output Report Format

After completing an operation, produce a structured report:

```markdown
## Git Report

### Operation performed
- [commit / pull request / branch / changelog / merge / cleanup]

### Branch
- Current branch: `feature/example`
- Base branch: `develop`

### Commits
| Hash | Type | Message |
|------|------|---------|
| abc1234 | feat | Add refresh token rotation |

### Pull Request
- URL: [link if created]
- Title: [title]
- Status: [open / draft / merged]

### Affected files
| File | Operation |
|------|-----------|
| src/auth/refresh.py | Modified |
| src/auth/tests/test_refresh.py | Created |

### Warnings
- [list of alerts, if any]

### Next steps
- [recommended actions, if any]
```

